{"title":"2013 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all positive real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> such that for any positive reals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, at least one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c419b042a8eeefcf7f1ec385d4c0fc23c452505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + \\dfrac{M}{ab}, b + \\dfrac{M}{bc}, c + \\dfrac{M}{ca}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"177\" height=\"37\" /> is greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd0d2d82d5acdd6da98043e23c2891a6f349e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We claim the only possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/f/31fd5f661cfa07469b6e0f748c9ab8ff9b664be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Consider the case where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566b9136144a62fac113ecbc8065793a74123238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />. Then, we force <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5ec6b7cef01214e595b65f5815e6de998f0b7bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + \\frac{M}{a^2} \\geq M + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"39\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84acd1ff62a8999edfd7446c204d6f90c3abd0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\mathbb{R}^+.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> Particularly, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d49733aab3aa938bd4ee7a02b0af57349dc9a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M + 1 \\leq \\text{min}(a + \\frac{M}{a^2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"39\" />. By AM-GM:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d565b20dde604d4edc6e2b83f8214730ac80b116.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{min}\\left(a + \\frac{M}{a^2}\\right) = \\text{min}\\left(\\frac{a}{2} + \\frac{a}{2}+\\frac{M}{a^2}\\right) = 3\\left(\\frac{M}{4}\\right)^{1/3}\\]\" width=\"394\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/f/8ef9169250c2fd142e21f6ec89ec7c8393538d3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M + 1 \\leq 3\\left(\\frac{M}{4}\\right)^{1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"160\" height=\"49\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f020c65be91c86e8593da956253fe6938ad010.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M + 1 = \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} + M \\geq 3\\left(\\frac{M}{4}\\right)^{1/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"274\" height=\"49\" />. Thus, we force equality, happening when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/48873ebd3f1593d46480197f359d0b0e79f4651f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = \\frac{1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We now show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/5000926c5dc9c2953c0df55431674fedcefb3dc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" /> does indeed work. \n</p><p>Suppose that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/5000926c5dc9c2953c0df55431674fedcefb3dc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"20\" />, there exists positive reals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> such that each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/e/edefd4808ee361772e6fd1e1603c3c4b7cfcbf05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + \\frac{1}{2ab}, b + \\frac{1}{2bc}, c + \\frac{1}{2ca}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfdbd19877c13d1755e01b54ba640f512c883a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. Consider the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/521cd4c6586833e238720bffc791876d5d29c208.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + \\frac{1}{2ab} &lt; \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />. Then, by AM-GM:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8b4d00baec3e1026680531540316a6f9f6ec3d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3}{2} &gt; \\frac{a}{2} + \\frac{a}{2} + \\frac{1}{2ab} \\geq \\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^{1/3}\\]\" width=\"232\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Which forces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bd359b97a74eab0c5cb18f75945a3a323e20e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &gt; \\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" />. Similarly, we also get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/9/979c37a230ca4c22bd67f0f63f472ed19c5bc21b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &gt; \\frac{b}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"39\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab657cbbc4d8e57ccfe103528d279e9e9ed215e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &gt; \\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" />, or that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ecbdceb9b5d9ab80aae88502a9b17889395108a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &gt; a &gt; c &gt; b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />, which is a contradiction, and we are done. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 91/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5130/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37747:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232717 and revision id 291756. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}